[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AGENTS-005
TITLE: inject_frontmatter — Insert YAML Metadata
STATEMENT: >>>
inject_frontmatter(content: str, role: str, config: dict) parses and modifies
agent frontmatter (YAML header between --- delimiters) with values from
config/role-defaults.yaml and project.yaml overrides:
  - model: LLM model (claude-opus-4-7, etc.)
  - memory: Memory type (project, local, user, none)
  - permissionMode: (allow, prompt, deny)
  - temperature: LLM param
  - tools: Available tools list
Updates frontmatter fields, preserves existing sections.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Centralized frontmatter injection prevents hardcoded values in templates.
Role configuration is dynamic and can be changed without modifying templates.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_agents.py::test_inject_frontmatter_model
- tests/test_agents.py::test_inject_frontmatter_memory
- tests/test_agents.py::test_inject_frontmatter_missing_creates_default
- tests/test_agents.py::test_inject_frontmatter_preserves_existing
<<<
