[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AGENTS-006
TITLE: build_agent — Orchestrate Full Composition Pipeline
STATEMENT: >>>
build_agent(project, role, agent_meta_root, provider=None) orchestrates:
  1. collect_sources(role) → get source from layers
  2. resolve_extends_chain(role) → if extends exists
  3. compose_agent(base, patches) → apply platform/project patches
  4. inject_frontmatter(content, role, config) → add role metadata
  5. Return final agent content ready for sync
Main composition orchestrator combining all lower-level operations.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Single orchestration point ensures consistent order of operations.
Separation of concerns (each sub-function does one thing) enables testing
and reuse.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_agents.py::test_build_agent_1generic_only
- tests/test_agents.py::test_build_agent_2platform_override
- tests/test_agents.py::test_build_agent_3project_override
- tests/test_agents.py::test_build_agent_extends_chain
- tests/test_agents.py::test_build_agent_e2e_full_pipeline
<<<
