[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AGENTS-007
TITLE: sync_agents_for_provider — Generate Agents per Provider
STATEMENT: >>>
For a single provider (claude, gemini, continue, opencode):
  1. Enumerate all required roles (from config/role-defaults.yaml)
  2. For each role, build_agent(role, provider=provider)
  3. Apply variable substitution ({{PLACEHOLDERS}})
  4. Write to .claude/agents/ (or provider-specific dir)
  5. Track written files in .agent-meta-managed index
Idempotent: re-running writes same content (no unnecessary changes).
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Provider-specific sync ensures each provider gets correctly configured agents
without cross-provider pollution. Idempotence prevents churn (commit noise).
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_agents.py::test_sync_agents_for_provider_claude
- tests/test_agents.py::test_sync_agents_for_provider_idempotent
- tests/test_agents.py::test_sync_agents_for_provider_optional_roles_skipped
- tests/test_agents.py::test_sync_agents_for_provider_dry_run
<<<
