[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AGENTS-010
TITLE: validate_agent_syntax — Check Agent Markdown Structure
STATEMENT: >>>
Validate that generated agent markdown:
  - Has frontmatter block (--- ... ---)
  - Contains required sections (varies by agent type)
  - All section headers are markdown (## format)
  - No orphaned content (all lines belong to sections)
Return: (bool, List[str]) with validity and error list.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Syntax validation catches structural errors before agents are deployed.
Prevents malformed agents from breaking provider tooling.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
